license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-06"
abstract: >-
  An SDK that turns EPUB and PDF books into complete, independently reviewed
  study guides, and exports them as Markdown, PDF, a concept-map graph, a
  claim audit and a reproducible manifest. Ships for Python, TypeScript,
  JavaScript, React and Next.js.
